{"4070520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Darkest Days: Ventania", "steam_appid": 4070520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DARK FANTASY ROLE-PLAYING GAME WITH HORROR AND SURVIVAL ELEMENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Steam page is under construction - there are a lot more features I wish to present you very soon!)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Continent of Euros holds many mysteries.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the dark fantasy world through a role of a hunter, a honored warrior of Ventania sent on a holy mission. World is split into two-layered design, upper layer holding vast landscapes, frozen regions and great castles, while lower one hosting underground cities, cursed mines and intertwining tunnels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070520/extras/15ca8562df7ec545406cba259e4e7737.poster.avif?t=1766787136\" aria-label=\"World theme\" width=920 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070520/extras/15ca8562df7ec545406cba259e4e7737.webm?t=1766787136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070520/extras/15ca8562df7ec545406cba259e4e7737.mp4?t=1766787136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight dangerous abominations dwelling beneath the ground.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat features different animations per weapon type and multiple attack moves and damage types. Weapons can be enhanced with status effects and damage modifiers. Use dodge, block and parry to survive your way through this unforgiving word.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070520/extras/49d96e033597f2b1cfd92c71f12349f0.poster.avif?t=1766787136\" aria-label=\"Fighting enemies\" width=920 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070520/extras/49d96e033597f2b1cfd92c71f12349f0.webm?t=1766787136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070520/extras/49d96e033597f2b1cfd92c71f12349f0.mp4?t=1766787136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Equip your character with modular armor sets and color them to your liking.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armors are made out of different materials you will encounter on your journey, but that does not mean fashion should suffer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070520/extras/707cc25c34e349a90dd00d9555f5ec2c.poster.avif?t=1766787136\" aria-label=\"Armor customization\" width=920 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070520/extras/707cc25c34e349a90dd00d9555f5ec2c.webm?t=1766787136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070520/extras/707cc25c34e349a90dd00d9555f5ec2c.mp4?t=1766787136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Smelt, craft, enhance and level your gear in a chase for a perfect build.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features, smelting of gathered ores and items, crafting gear and then modifying it with countless status effects and modifiers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070520/extras/14fd68dae26874b736e07e1af585666b.poster.avif?t=1766787136\" width=920 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070520/extras/14fd68dae26874b736e07e1af585666b.webm?t=1766787136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070520/extras/14fd68dae26874b736e07e1af585666b.mp4?t=1766787136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES OVERVIEW:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WORLD:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World is split into lower and upper layer with each interacting differently with player mechanics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>REST:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day number system - each time you rest, game saves and new day starts, each day holds different modifiers for the creatures you will be fighting as well changing layout of some parts of the map slightly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up system to enhance basic and combat stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send items up the elevator or leave them at special places to wake up to traded ones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recharge your stamina reserves to continue exploration at full strength</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GATHERING and BUTCHERY:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather basic resources and butcher enemies after defeating them in combat to acquire unique items</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CRAFTING and UPGRADING:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft, upgrade and level up your gear to face stronger foes. Smelt ores, insert glyphs and enhance your weapons and armor with powerful effects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMBAT:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a mobile hunter, focusing on speed and precision, or equip yourself with heavy armor and force your way with sheer toughness. Combat features: block, parry, dodge and variety of melee attacks and range options.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZATION:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armor up in full sets or combine pieces and color them to achieve the perfect look. Features light character customization and a lot of color presets for your modular gear.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dev note: I'm a single dev taking a huge task that is making this game, I'm open to all constructive feedback will appreciate honesty the most!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><br></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DARK FANTASY ROLE-PLAYING GAME WITH HORROR AND SURVIVAL ELEMENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Steam page is under construction - there are a lot more features I wish to present you very soon!)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Continent of Euros holds many mysteries.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the dark fantasy world through a role of a hunter, a honored warrior of Ventania sent on a holy mission. World is split into two-layered design, upper layer holding vast landscapes, frozen regions and great castles, while lower one hosting underground cities, cursed mines and intertwining tunnels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070520/extras/15ca8562df7ec545406cba259e4e7737.poster.avif?t=1766787136\" aria-label=\"World theme\" width=920 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070520/extras/15ca8562df7ec545406cba259e4e7737.webm?t=1766787136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070520/extras/15ca8562df7ec545406cba259e4e7737.mp4?t=1766787136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight dangerous abominations dwelling beneath the ground.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat features different animations per weapon type and multiple attack moves and damage types. Weapons can be enhanced with status effects and damage modifiers. Use dodge, block and parry to survive your way through this unforgiving word.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070520/extras/49d96e033597f2b1cfd92c71f12349f0.poster.avif?t=1766787136\" aria-label=\"Fighting enemies\" width=920 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070520/extras/49d96e033597f2b1cfd92c71f12349f0.webm?t=1766787136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070520/extras/49d96e033597f2b1cfd92c71f12349f0.mp4?t=1766787136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Equip your character with modular armor sets and color them to your liking.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armors are made out of different materials you will encounter on your journey, but that does not mean fashion should suffer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070520/extras/707cc25c34e349a90dd00d9555f5ec2c.poster.avif?t=1766787136\" aria-label=\"Arm