 up system to enhance basic and combat stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send items up the elevator or leave them at special places to wake up to traded ones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recharge your stamina reserves to continue exploration at full strength</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GATHERING and BUTCHERY:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather basic resources and butcher enemies after defeating them in combat to acquire unique items</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CRAFTING and UPGRADING:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft, upgrade and level up your gear to face stronger foes. Smelt ores, insert glyphs and enhance your weapons and armor with powerful effects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMBAT:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a mobile hunter, focusing on speed and precision, or equip yourself with heavy armor and force your way with sheer toughness. Combat features: block, parry, dodge and variety of melee attacks and range options.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZATION:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armor up in full sets or combine pieces and color them to achieve the perfect look. Features light character customization and a lot of color presets for your modular gear.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dev note: I'm a single dev taking a huge task that is making this game, I'm open to all constructive feedback will appreciate honesty the most!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><br></p>", "short_description": "Its your time hunter, honor the endless tradition and free our God from the curse below. Make your character, slay monsters to get stronger and challenge powerful entities in this rich dark fantasy world. Play the role of the hunter while you gather, craft, upgrade an